      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哎呀，你跟谁说话呢。\n――我可是“第一”的赛马娘，大和赤骥哦？",
      "source_fingerprint": "942874be294c4f8cbebeff3bafe143a177071d52af24aa169975b9a08a437989",
