    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c54053795c95ad8285e89400",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "选拔赛过几天后。我还是很在意大和赤骥。\n想再和她好好聊一次――",
      "source_fingerprint": "79c995d08d5b8d8ff336daff023bbb9a4bbbfa1e19cd345682fe9973e7d569ab",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1009/storytimeline_041009002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf4aa85965b4388677b2607f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我怀着这样的心情，找到大和赤骥时，\n发现已经有很多训练员围着她了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8908b240862113a476785c63312dbac41b8d8b3670d58fda76f881e010c3822",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
